{
    "0": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place looks completely different",
                "than what it looks like from above."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's like it's nighttime inside the sanctuary."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's beautiful, but...",
                "What's going on here?"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hoho, you're..."
            ]
        },
        "156_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way! A human down here?"
            ]
        },
        "164_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're..."
            ]
        },
        "172_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, what are you?",
                "Seriously, what <i$are> you?"
            ]
        },
        "180_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huhuhu. If you've been left behind,",
                "you'd better run while you still can."
            ]
        },
        "188_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All the yamanba and monkeys who",
                "once lived here have already fled."
            ]
        },
        "196_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even now, you can still escape this sanctuary.",
                "Though it's one-way, mind you."
            ]
        },
        "204_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Even that Chirizuka fellow looked like",
                "this is the first time she'd seen this happen."
            ]
        },
        "212_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I won't be running away,",
                "I came in from the outside to investigate."
            ]
        },
        "220_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You came in from the outside?!"
            ]
        },
        "228_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Boy, I don't appreciate lies.",
                "There's no way you could've done that..."
            ]
        },
        "236_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's no way that's possible at all!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That blue stone that changes your surroundings...",
                "its power should not be held by humans."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, I see.",
                "You came in using the stone's power."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's the case, probably."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyway, how come you're trying to seal off this place?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm...?",
                "Well, this has been going on for a while now..."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Actually, events like this aren't uncommon,",
                "that's why they call these places sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've seen this happen many times over, though."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, you're saying that this is just an unusual natural phenomenon?",
                "That's a tall claim, but..."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, given that the event occurs naturally,",
                "it's nothing more than a natural phenomenon."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Is that even possible?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, I believe it has something to do",
                "with that underground altar."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Altar...?",
                "Where is it?"
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There is a cave up ahead.",
                "Nobody goes near it usually, though."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Putting that aside, isn't that blue stone",
                "filled with the power of nature!"
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It might upset the altar's master."
            ]
        }
    }
}